<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lam Research raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lam Research raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowen &amp; Co said it upgraded Lam Research Corp to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Lam Research gained 3-7/16 to 53-1/16.</p>
</text>
